# Keep the build context lean — repo-root build for the worker only needs
# the analysis-engine/ and worker/ trees plus a couple of metadata files.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.git
**/.github
**/docs
**/tests
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
**/.env*
**/*.md
# The worker persists results through the backend's ORM models, so the
# `app` package must remain in the build context. Everything else under
# backend/ is excluded to keep the context lean.
backend/alembic/
backend/tests/
backend/Dockerfile
backend/.dockerignore
frontend/
infrastructure/
docker/
scripts/
